{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門發生火警。昨日（28日）早上11時許，屯門良德街、寶怡商場對開一個環保斗突然起火，火勢波及面積約半米乘半米，消防接報到場將火撲熄，經調查後，相信煙灰誤跌環保斗肇禍，無人受傷。</p><p>根據網上影片和圖像，環保斗火光熊熊，消防在場撲火，現場冒出白煙，途人站在遠處觀望。</p><figure><img alt=\"環保斗火光熊熊，消防在場撲火。（Threads@pakconnect_hk影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261129/1203524931602616320507328.jpeg/GF3j0XxWP07CcByqJ8Pfm6d-34WIqfs512qfdNdqn3Q\"/><figcaption>環保斗火光熊熊，消防在場撲火。（Threads@pakconnect_hk影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場冒出白煙。（Facebook群組「真.屯門友」圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261129/1203524995356037120714268.jpeg/SkpfwSlLbrEG2ouImZOxjU0DLasC_SKaMUG45zFBuOc\"/><figcaption>現場冒出白煙。（Facebook群組「真.屯門友」圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T18:02:38.321945+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T17:51:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:56:07.914444+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T17:56:07.914444+00:00","content_hash":"dc53b9681b463f6b84a7dec60d4baf2974bd97a6a0700498df188cb745d42559","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}